{"channelId":"UCg5VrHCw9kJZk-KZ6qBNEuw","row":["Erik Dalton",214602,"Advanced manual therapy techniques for massage therapists and other allied health professionals. Learn through hands-on demonstrations featuring Erik Dalton and other certified Master Myoskeletal Therapists in action. \n\nErik Dalton, Ph.D, was a recognized pioneer in the massage therapy and bodywork community. He was the founder of Freedom from Pain Institute and creator of the Dalton Myoskeletal Alignment Techniques® (MAT), a system of innovative manual therapy techniques borne out of Rolfing, osteopathy, and brain-based approaches to therapy.\n\nErik Dalton had 30 years of experience teaching MAT and was a faculty member in the Department of Applied Medicine and Rehabilitation at Indiana State University. His legacy continues on through his daughter Dr Adrienne Kesinger and his senior educators. \n\nFor more information visit http://erikdalton.com\n\nFacebook Myoskeletal Alignment Techniques Group https://www.facebook.com/groups/erikdalton/\nInstagram https://instagram.com/daltonmyoskeletal","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCg5VrHCw9kJZk-KZ6qBNEuw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCg5VrHCw9kJZk-KZ6qBNEuw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:10.620Z","channelId":"UCg5VrHCw9kJZk-KZ6qBNEuw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"44e26f4ce4c3ae1027b110821e203ecf00e74c5be50d2839acb367221f52cc42","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"25731ecc31d8a920e816fbfbe1cf020d348ab8a23a0d845f782d3b99b807049e"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCg5VrHCw9kJZk-KZ6qBNEuw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:19:58.917Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"instagram","url":"https://www.instagram.com/daltonmyoskeletal","identityStatus":"cross_linked","value":214602,"raw":"214602","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.instagram.com/daltonmyoskeletal/","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:28:16.161Z"},{"platform":"facebook","url":"h